menu "Warpei control board"

config WARPEI_BENCH_NO_SENSOR
    bool "Bench mode: run without the MLX90614 (NOT for the assembled projector)"
    default n
    help
        When the MLX90614 probe fails at boot, substitute a constant 25.0 C
        reading instead of latching the sensor fault, so the state machine,
        buttons and LED output can be exercised on a bare control PCB.
        Every TEMPERATURE message carries fan_rpm = 0xFFFF as a marker.
        Leave this off for any build that drives the real LED heatsink.

endmenu
